sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant ProductAPI
    participant Database
    participant WebhookDispatcher
    participant WarehouseSystem
    participant PricingSystem
    participant NotificationService
    participant EmailService

    Note over Customer,EmailService: 1. Customer Places Order

    Customer->>ProductAPI: POST /api/products/1/stock<br/>{quantity: 5, operation: "subtract"}
    activate ProductAPI
    
    ProductAPI->>Database: Find Product by ID
    Database-->>ProductAPI: Product (stock: 50)
    
    ProductAPI->>Database: Update Stock (50 → 45)
    Database-->>ProductAPI: Product Updated
    
    Note over ProductAPI: Check if stock < threshold
    
    ProductAPI->>WebhookDispatcher: dispatchProductEvent()<br/>"product.stock.updated"
    activate WebhookDispatcher
    
    ProductAPI-->>Customer: 200 OK<br/>{product with new stock}
    deactivate ProductAPI
    
    Note over WebhookDispatcher,NotificationService: 2. Webhook Processing (Async)
    
    WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Find Active Subscriptions<br/>for "product.stock.updated"
    Database-->>WebhookDispatcher: [Warehouse, Pricing, Analytics]
    
    WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Create WebhookDelivery Records<br/>(status: PENDING)
    
    par Parallel Webhook Deliveries
        WebhookDispatcher->>WarehouseSystem: POST webhook<br/>X-Webhook-Signature: abc123<br/>Payload: {stock change}
        activate WarehouseSystem
        WarehouseSystem->>WarehouseSystem: Verify Signature
        WarehouseSystem->>WarehouseSystem: Update Inventory System
        WarehouseSystem-->>WebhookDispatcher: 200 OK
        deactivate WarehouseSystem
        WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Update Delivery<br/>(status: DELIVERED)
        
        WebhookDispatcher->>PricingSystem: POST webhook<br/>X-Webhook-Signature: def456<br/>Payload: {stock change}
        activate PricingSystem
        PricingSystem->>PricingSystem: Verify Signature
        PricingSystem->>PricingSystem: Adjust Dynamic Pricing
        PricingSystem-->>WebhookDispatcher: 200 OK
        deactivate PricingSystem
        WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Update Delivery<br/>(status: DELIVERED)
    end
    
    deactivate WebhookDispatcher
    
    Note over ProductAPI,EmailService: 3. Low Stock Alert Triggered
    
    rect rgb(255, 200, 200)
        Note over ProductAPI: Stock now 45, threshold 50<br/>Trigger Low Stock Alert
        
        ProductAPI->>WebhookDispatcher: dispatchProductEvent()<br/>"product.stock.low"
        activate WebhookDispatcher
        
        WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Find Subscriptions<br/>for "product.stock.low"
        Database-->>WebhookDispatcher: [Warehouse, Purchasing]
        
        WebhookDispatcher->>WarehouseSystem: POST webhook<br/>"product.stock.low"
        activate WarehouseSystem
        WarehouseSystem->>WarehouseSystem: Auto-trigger<br/>Purchase Order
        WarehouseSystem-->>WebhookDispatcher: 200 OK
        deactivate WarehouseSystem
        
        WebhookDispatcher->>NotificationService: POST webhook<br/>"product.stock.low"
        activate NotificationService
        NotificationService->>EmailService: Send Alert Email<br/>to inventory@company.com
        EmailService-->>NotificationService: Email Sent
        NotificationService-->>WebhookDispatcher: 200 OK
        deactivate NotificationService
        
        deactivate WebhookDispatcher
    end
    
    Note over Customer,EmailService: 4. Background Monitoring
    
    loop Every 1 Minute
        WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Check Failed Deliveries
        alt Has Failed Deliveries
            WebhookDispatcher->>WarehouseSystem: Retry Failed Webhook
            alt Success
                WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Mark as DELIVERED
            else Still Failing
                WebhookDispatcher->>Database: Schedule Next Retry<br/>(Exponential Backoff)
            end
        end
    end